{
 "encounter_id": "00795",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Mr Menon, the booking says headaches with light sensitivity. Is that right?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes, doctor. I've been so worried. They're throbbing, on the right side, and the light hurts my eyes, and I keep thinking it's a tumour."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I understand the worry. Let's find out what's going on. How long?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "About six months. Two times a week, roughly. Do you think it could be serious?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let's get the facts first. When one starts, what happens?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "First, I see zigzag lights, for twenty minutes. Then the headache. And then I feel sick. Nauseous, I mean."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Does light bother you during the headache?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes, I have to go into a dark room. Even my phone screen hurts."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any weakness on one side, or trouble speaking?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No weakness, doctor. Is that good?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It is. Any fever or stiff neck with it?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No fever, no stiff neck."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any head injury recently?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, I haven't hit my head."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What medicines do you use?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Paracetamol, 1 gram, when the headache comes. Ibuprofen, 400 mg, also when it comes. And amitriptyline, 10 mg, at night, my GP started it."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any allergies to medicines?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Penicillin. My face swelled up once."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Your health history?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Anxiety, since college. And iron deficiency anaemia, two years ago."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Operations?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Tonsillectomy at seven. Wisdom teeth, in 2018."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Headaches in the family?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My mother gets migraines."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What's your work?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Software engineer, ten hours a day in front of screens."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Caffeine?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Three cups of chai every day, and a coffee."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me check your pulse and pressure. Pulse 72, blood pressure 120 over 76.",
   "pause": 10.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Normal? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Normal. Now follow my finger with your eyes.",
   "pause": 8.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Like this? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Your pupils are equal and react to light, and the eye movements are normal."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "What does that mean? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It means no sign of pressure on the nerves. Your neck is supple and not stiff either, and there's no tenderness over the temples."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "And the tumour? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me ask about your vision between headaches. Any changes, double vision?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing, my vision is fine between them."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And any numbness, tingling?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, no tingling."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Everything points to migraine, with aura, the zigzag lights. I can't rule out a tension-type headache contributing, given the screens and the stress."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "But why not a tumour? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Nothing in the examination suggests it, but because you're worried I'd like to arrange an MRI of the brain."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Thank you, I will sleep better. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd also like to do blood tests for thyroid and iron, and an eye test with an optometrist."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Good, good. And the headaches themselves? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Keep a headache diary, and take the paracetamol early, at the first sign."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I'll start tonight. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to see you again in six weeks."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Six weeks. Thank you, doctor, I feel better already. ~"
  }
 ],
